{"id":"vol8-02","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-02/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":332.21,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.38,"text":"Part 4. You will hear part of a presentation to biology students on new research into sea lions.","words":[["Part",0.0,0.34],["4.",0.34,0.84],["You",1.8,2.38],["will",2.38,2.54],["hear",2.54,2.82],["part",2.82,3.12],["of",3.12,3.32],["a",3.32,3.42],["presentation",3.42,3.92],["to",3.92,4.44],["biology",4.44,4.9],["students",4.9,5.52],["on",5.52,6.26],["new",6.26,6.58],["research",6.58,7.18],["into",7.18,7.54],["sea",7.54,7.9],["lions.",7.9,8.38]]},{"start":9.74,"end":68.51,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["First",9.74,10.46],["you",10.46,10.7],["have",10.7,10.88],["some",10.88,11.08],["time",11.08,11.5],["to",11.5,11.8],["look",11.8,11.92],["at",11.92,12.08],["questions",12.08,12.4],["31",12.4,13.24],["to",13.24,13.52],["40.",13.52,13.92],["Now",64.59,64.91],["listen",64.91,65.29],["carefully",65.29,65.75],["and",65.75,66.13],["answer",66.13,66.59],["questions",66.59,67.07],["31",67.07,67.87],["to",67.87,68.13],["40.",68.13,68.51]]},{"start":71.88,"end":77.72,"text":"Hello everybody. I'm here today to tell you about a new research study that my team here at the","words":[["Hello",71.88,72.28],["everybody.",72.28,72.64],["I'm",73.52,73.8],["here",73.8,73.96],["today",73.96,74.3],["to",74.3,74.56],["tell",74.56,74.74],["you",74.74,74.84],["about",74.84,75.04],["a",75.04,75.24],["new",75.24,75.36],["research",75.36,75.86],["study",75.86,76.3],["that",76.3,76.58],["my",76.58,76.8],["team",76.8,77.2],["here",77.2,77.52],["at",77.52,77.64],["the",77.64,77.72]]},{"start":77.72,"end":82.34,"text":"university is doing on the sea lions that live along the coast of Western Australia.","words":[["university",77.72,78.24],["is",78.24,78.5],["doing",78.5,78.74],["on",78.74,79.36],["the",79.36,79.5],["sea",79.5,79.72],["lions",79.72,80.12],["that",80.12,80.5],["live",80.5,80.7],["along",80.7,80.9],["the",80.9,81.14],["coast",81.14,81.4],["of",81.4,81.64],["Western",81.64,81.84],["Australia.",81.84,82.34]]},{"start":83.24,"end":88.28,"text":"You may be wondering why we've been studying this animal. Well, Australian sea lions have","words":[["You",83.24,83.62],["may",83.62,83.76],["be",83.76,83.92],["wondering",83.92,84.18],["why",84.18,84.52],["we've",84.52,84.7],["been",84.7,84.84],["studying",84.84,85.22],["this",85.22,85.52],["animal.",85.52,85.9],["Well,",86.56,86.8],["Australian",86.92,87.32],["sea",87.32,87.74],["lions",87.74,88.1],["have",88.1,88.28]]},{"start":88.28,"end":93.3,"text":"been identified as an endangered species, so there's a real need to count them and","words":[["been",88.28,88.4],["identified",88.4,88.94],["as",88.94,89.32],["an",89.32,89.44],["endangered",89.44,89.82],["species,",89.82,90.44],["so",90.84,91.4],["there's",91.4,91.7],["a",91.7,91.78],["real",91.78,91.96],["need",91.96,92.2],["to",92.2,92.38],["count",92.38,92.6],["them",92.6,92.9],["and",92.9,93.3]]},{"start":93.3,"end":100.14,"text":"find out just how many there are. Up until 1892, the population of these animals was","words":[["find",93.3,93.56],["out",93.56,93.78],["just",93.78,94.06],["how",94.06,94.34],["many",94.34,94.54],["there",94.54,94.76],["are.",94.76,95.1],["Up",96.18,96.48],["until",96.48,96.72],["1892,",96.72,97.92],["the",98.42,98.5],["population",98.5,98.94],["of",98.94,99.32],["these",99.32,99.5],["animals",99.5,99.9],["was",99.9,100.14]]},{"start":100.14,"end":106.12,"text":"severely depleted because of hunting. That's no longer allowed. But today, there","words":[["severely",100.14,100.56],["depleted",100.56,101.22],["because",101.22,101.58],["of",101.58,101.92],["hunting.",101.92,102.24],["That's",102.98,103.42],["no",103.42,103.6],["longer",103.6,103.88],["allowed.",103.88,104.36],["But",104.94,105.34],["today,",105.34,105.76],["there",105.94,106.12]]},{"start":106.12,"end":112.02,"text":"is a new danger. Sea lions often forage for food in the same areas along the coastlines","words":[["is",106.12,106.34],["a",106.34,106.44],["new",106.44,106.64],["danger.",106.64,107.1],["Sea",107.96,108.28],["lions",108.28,108.6],["often",108.6,108.98],["forage",108.98,109.46],["for",109.46,109.62],["food",109.62,109.92],["in",109.92,110.22],["the",110.22,110.34],["same",110.34,110.56],["areas",110.56,110.96],["along",110.96,111.22],["the",111.22,111.4],["coastlines",111.4,112.02]]},{"start":112.02,"end":117.66,"text":"where there are nets used to catch sharks. Unfortunately, they tend to get caught up in the nets by","words":[["where",112.02,112.24],["there",112.24,112.4],["are",112.4,112.5],["nets",112.5,112.76],["used",112.76,113.04],["to",113.04,113.22],["catch",113.22,113.42],["sharks.",113.42,113.9],["Unfortunately,",114.9,115.46],["they",115.84,115.98],["tend",115.98,116.18],["to",116.18,116.32],["get",116.32,116.4],["caught",116.4,116.68],["up",116.68,116.9],["in",116.9,117.0],["the",117.0,117.08],["nets",117.08,117.34],["by",117.34,117.66]]},{"start":117.66,"end":123.6,"text":"accident and drown. Now, we wanted to monitor the population of sea lions in this area,","words":[["accident",117.66,118.08],["and",118.08,118.56],["drown.",118.56,118.88],["Now,",119.76,120.1],["we",120.28,120.48],["wanted",120.48,120.76],["to",120.76,120.92],["monitor",120.92,121.22],["the",121.22,121.44],["population",121.44,121.88],["of",121.88,122.26],["sea",122.26,122.48],["lions",122.48,122.8],["in",122.8,123.08],["this",123.08,123.24],["area,",123.24,123.6]]},{"start":123.8,"end":128.9,"text":"but we weren't sure of the best way to do it. There are several different animal-tracking methods","words":[["but",123.8,124.2],["we",124.2,124.32],["weren't",124.32,124.52],["sure",124.52,124.74],["of",124.74,124.88],["the",124.88,124.98],["best",124.98,125.22],["way",125.22,125.42],["to",125.42,125.6],["do",125.6,125.78],["it.",125.78,125.98],["There",126.72,127.04],["are",127.04,127.18],["several",127.18,127.48],["different",127.48,127.76],["animal",127.76,128.16],["-tracking",128.16,128.52],["methods",128.52,128.9]]},{"start":128.9,"end":133.42,"text":"which vary in their effectiveness, and there are different factors to consider.","words":[["which",128.9,129.7],["vary",129.7,130.02],["in",130.02,130.24],["their",130.24,130.38],["effectiveness,",130.38,130.86],["and",131.32,131.84],["there",131.84,132.0],["are",132.0,132.08],["different",132.08,132.36],["factors",132.36,132.78],["to",132.78,133.02],["consider.",133.02,133.42]]},{"start":134.06,"end":139.56,"text":"One of the most important of these is the cost, but you also have to consider how easy your","words":[["One",134.06,134.66],["of",134.66,134.8],["the",134.8,134.88],["most",134.88,135.06],["important",135.06,135.48],["of",135.48,135.7],["these",135.7,135.92],["is",135.92,136.28],["the",136.28,136.44],["cost,",136.44,136.86],["but",137.2,137.68],["you",137.68,137.82],["also",137.82,138.12],["have",138.12,138.32],["to",138.32,138.44],["consider",138.44,138.78],["how",138.78,139.06],["easy",139.06,139.38],["your",139.38,139.56]]},{"start":139.56,"end":140.98,"text":"chosen method is to use.","words":[["chosen",139.56,139.92],["method",139.92,140.28],["is",140.28,140.5],["to",140.5,140.66],["use.",140.66,140.98]]},{"start":141.86,"end":144.9,"text":"You may choose a traditional method, like a plastic tag.","words":[["You",141.86,142.04],["may",142.04,142.18],["choose",142.18,142.46],["a",142.46,142.64],["traditional",142.64,143.0],["method,",143.0,143.5],["like",143.76,144.0],["a",144.0,144.1],["plastic",144.1,144.44],["tag.",144.44,144.9]]},{"start":145.82,"end":150.26,"text":"They're relatively straightforward to attach, but they're really only suitable to use with","words":[["They're",145.82,146.2],["relatively",146.2,146.54],["straightforward",146.54,147.06],["to",147.06,147.4],["attach,",147.4,147.7],["but",148.14,148.3],["they're",148.3,148.6],["really",148.6,148.94],["only",148.94,149.24],["suitable",149.24,149.6],["to",149.6,149.92],["use",149.92,150.08],["with",150.08,150.26]]},{"start":150.26,"end":152.08,"text":"animals that you can catch quite easily.","words":[["animals",150.26,150.54],["that",150.54,150.84],["you",150.84,150.94],["can",150.94,151.1],["catch",151.1,151.46],["quite",151.46,151.72],["easily.",151.72,152.08]]},{"start":152.98,"end":158.52,"text":"You might also go with a more modern method like GPS tracking, which uses satellite technology","words":[["You",152.98,153.26],["might",153.26,153.42],["also",153.42,153.78],["go",153.78,154.0],["with",154.0,154.16],["a",154.16,154.24],["more",154.24,154.38],["modern",154.38,154.7],["method",154.7,155.08],["like",155.08,155.28],["GPS",155.28,155.78],["tracking,",155.78,156.32],["which",156.8,157.08],["uses",157.08,157.3],["satellite",157.3,157.74],["technology",157.74,158.52]]},{"start":158.52,"end":161.04,"text":"to transmit data on the animal around the clock.","words":[["to",158.52,158.74],["transmit",158.74,159.2],["data",159.2,159.6],["on",159.6,159.9],["the",159.9,160.02],["animal",160.02,160.3],["around",160.3,160.58],["the",160.58,160.78],["clock.",160.78,161.04]]},{"start":161.84,"end":166.8,"text":"One drawback for marine animals though is that they don't transmit a signal in the ocean.","words":[["One",161.84,162.4],["drawback",162.4,162.96],["for",162.96,163.22],["marine",163.22,163.48],["animals",163.48,163.9],["though",163.9,164.22],["is",164.22,164.82],["that",164.82,164.92],["they",164.92,165.02],["don't",165.02,165.2],["transmit",165.2,165.68],["a",165.68,165.86],["signal",165.86,166.18],["in",166.18,166.4],["the",166.4,166.5],["ocean.",166.5,166.8]]},{"start":167.52,"end":169.66,"text":"You only get data when they're on land.","words":[["You",167.52,167.72],["only",167.72,168.04],["get",168.04,168.24],["data",168.24,168.64],["when",168.64,169.0],["they're",169.0,169.16],["on",169.16,169.28],["land.",169.28,169.66]]},{"start":170.74,"end":175.28,"text":"There are certain large animals in remote areas that have to be tracked using a helicopter.","words":[["There",170.74,170.96],["are",170.96,171.08],["certain",171.08,171.4],["large",171.4,171.72],["animals",171.72,172.22],["in",172.22,172.5],["remote",172.5,172.72],["areas",172.72,173.18],["that",173.18,173.38],["have",173.38,173.78],["to",173.78,173.92],["be",173.92,174.02],["tracked",174.02,174.3],["using",174.3,174.6],["a",174.6,174.8],["helicopter.",174.8,175.28]]},{"start":176.18,"end":177.7,"text":"The polar bear is a good example.","words":[["The",176.18,176.32],["polar",176.32,176.58],["bear",176.58,176.84],["is",176.84,177.04],["a",177.04,177.16],["good",177.16,177.24],["example.",177.24,177.7]]},{"start":178.88,"end":182.84,"text":"Now, an important part of tracking is being able to clearly identify the animal.","words":[["Now,",178.88,179.12],["an",179.32,179.38],["important",179.38,179.78],["part",179.78,180.1],["of",180.1,180.26],["tracking",180.26,180.58],["is",180.58,180.8],["being",180.8,180.96],["able",180.96,181.24],["to",181.24,181.38],["clearly",181.38,181.66],["identify",181.66,182.24],["the",182.24,182.52],["animal.",182.52,182.84]]},{"start":183.5,"end":187.48,"text":"Some, like zebras, are identified by markings such as their stripes.","words":[["Some,",183.5,183.98],["like",184.12,184.38],["zebras,",184.38,184.9],["are",185.14,185.26],["identified",185.26,185.66],["by",185.66,186.0],["markings",186.0,186.4],["such",186.4,186.78],["as",186.78,186.92],["their",186.92,187.1],["stripes.",187.1,187.48]]},{"start":187.48,"end":192.22,"text":"ships, while the dolphin usually has distinguishing scars on its body that can help tell them","words":[["ships,",187.48,187.6],["while",188.26,188.46],["the",188.46,188.62],["dolphin",188.62,188.88],["usually",188.88,189.24],["has",189.24,189.48],["distinguishing",189.48,190.08],["scars",190.08,190.44],["on",190.44,190.76],["its",190.76,190.88],["body",190.88,191.2],["that",191.2,191.46],["can",191.46,191.6],["help",191.6,191.84],["tell",191.84,192.06],["them",192.06,192.22]]},{"start":192.22,"end":196.7,"text":"apart. Sea lions don't have any markings like this,","words":[["apart.",192.22,192.62],["Sea",194.04,194.38],["lions",194.38,194.72],["don't",194.72,195.14],["have",195.14,195.28],["any",195.28,195.58],["markings",195.58,195.98],["like",195.98,196.34],["this,",196.34,196.7]]},{"start":197.16,"end":202.72,"text":"which is just one of the challenges of tracking them. When researchers in Perth tried to use","words":[["which",197.16,197.42],["is",197.42,197.56],["just",197.56,197.76],["one",197.76,198.04],["of",198.04,198.16],["the",198.16,198.26],["challenges",198.26,198.66],["of",198.66,198.88],["tracking",198.88,199.2],["them.",199.2,199.44],["When",200.48,200.86],["researchers",200.86,201.42],["in",201.42,201.68],["Perth",201.68,202.1],["tried",202.1,202.38],["to",202.38,202.56],["use",202.56,202.72]]},{"start":202.72,"end":207.96,"text":"electronic tags in a sea lion study, they found that the sea lions had removed their","words":[["electronic",202.72,203.2],["tags",203.2,203.72],["in",203.72,203.96],["a",203.96,204.12],["sea",204.12,204.28],["lion",204.28,204.58],["study,",204.58,205.0],["they",205.54,205.76],["found",205.76,206.14],["that",206.14,206.3],["the",206.3,206.46],["sea",206.46,206.68],["lions",206.68,206.98],["had",206.98,207.14],["removed",207.14,207.62],["their",207.62,207.96]]},{"start":207.96,"end":212.38,"text":"tracking devices by deliberately rubbing up against rocks. This was something the","words":[["tracking",207.96,208.28],["devices",208.28,208.76],["by",208.76,209.04],["deliberately",209.04,209.42],["rubbing",209.42,209.74],["up",209.74,209.94],["against",209.94,210.24],["rocks.",210.24,210.64],["This",211.38,211.62],["was",211.62,211.84],["something",211.84,212.18],["the",212.18,212.38]]},{"start":212.38,"end":217.94,"text":"researchers hadn't anticipated. Researchers in California studying American sea","words":[["researchers",212.38,212.74],["hadn't",212.74,213.34],["anticipated.",213.34,213.96],["Researchers",214.98,215.62],["in",215.62,216.0],["California",216.0,216.54],["studying",216.54,217.14],["American",217.14,217.56],["sea",217.56,217.94]]},{"start":217.94,"end":224.1,"text":"lines tried a different method. They applied paint to the animals. They thought","words":[["lines",217.94,218.3],["tried",218.3,218.62],["a",218.62,218.94],["different",218.94,219.18],["method.",219.18,219.64],["They",220.76,221.02],["applied",221.02,221.48],["paint",221.48,221.92],["to",221.92,222.18],["the",222.18,222.3],["animals.",222.3,222.64],["They",223.64,223.86],["thought",223.86,224.1]]},{"start":224.1,"end":229.06,"text":"this would be a better less invasive means of identification. Unfortunately","words":[["this",224.1,224.36],["would",224.36,224.5],["be",224.5,224.66],["a",224.66,224.76],["better",224.76,225.06],["less",225.06,225.42],["invasive",225.42,225.92],["means",225.92,226.32],["of",226.32,226.52],["identification.",226.52,227.22],["Unfortunately",228.38,229.06]]},{"start":229.06,"end":233.44,"text":"this didn't work so well either because sea lines molt every year and shed","words":[["this",229.06,229.56],["didn't",229.56,229.88],["work",229.88,230.08],["so",230.08,230.34],["well",230.34,230.54],["either",230.54,230.84],["because",230.84,231.16],["sea",231.16,231.54],["lines",231.54,231.86],["molt",231.86,232.18],["every",232.18,232.56],["year",232.56,232.96],["and",232.96,233.2],["shed",233.2,233.44]]},{"start":233.44,"end":242.69,"text":"their fur along with the identifying mark. So let's look at our current study.","words":[["their",233.44,233.7],["fur",233.7,234.0],["along",234.0,234.42],["with",234.42,234.72],["the",234.72,234.82],["identifying",234.82,235.42],["mark.",235.42,235.78],["So",240.89,241.29],["let's",241.29,241.59],["look",241.59,241.73],["at",241.73,241.85],["our",241.85,242.05],["current",242.05,242.29],["study.",242.29,242.69]]},{"start":242.69,"end":245.73,"text":"We have several aims that we'd like to achieve.","words":[["We",242.69,243.71],["have",243.71,243.91],["several",243.91,244.29],["aims",244.29,244.69],["that",244.69,244.87],["we'd",244.87,244.99],["like",244.99,245.13],["to",245.13,245.33],["achieve.",245.33,245.73]]},{"start":246.49,"end":251.23,"text":"The first of these is to try to establish whether sea lions can be identified from the whiskers","words":[["The",246.49,246.65],["first",246.65,246.97],["of",246.97,247.15],["these",247.15,247.33],["is",247.33,247.51],["to",247.51,247.63],["try",247.63,247.85],["to",247.85,247.99],["establish",247.99,248.41],["whether",248.41,248.71],["sea",248.71,249.03],["lions",249.03,249.37],["can",249.37,249.61],["be",249.61,249.75],["identified",249.75,250.31],["from",250.31,250.63],["the",250.63,250.79],["whiskers",250.79,251.23]]},{"start":251.23,"end":251.83,"text":"on their face.","words":[["on",251.23,251.37],["their",251.37,251.55],["face.",251.55,251.83]]},{"start":252.97,"end":256.13,"text":"These are much coarser than a cat's whiskers so easier to see.","words":[["These",252.97,253.25],["are",253.25,253.43],["much",253.43,253.59],["coarser",253.59,254.11],["than",254.11,254.19],["a",254.19,254.31],["cat's",254.31,254.67],["whiskers",254.67,255.03],["so",255.03,255.25],["easier",255.25,255.61],["to",255.61,255.83],["see.",255.83,256.13]]},{"start":257.01,"end":262.77,"text":"Our theory is that the pattern of these whiskers may be as individual as a fingerprint on","words":[["Our",257.01,257.35],["theory",257.35,257.69],["is",257.69,258.27],["that",258.27,258.39],["the",258.39,258.47],["pattern",258.47,258.75],["of",258.75,258.91],["these",258.91,259.05],["whiskers",259.05,259.67],["may",259.67,260.09],["be",260.09,260.41],["as",260.41,260.71],["individual",260.71,261.33],["as",261.33,261.81],["a",261.81,261.93],["fingerprint",261.93,262.37],["on",262.37,262.77]]},{"start":262.77,"end":263.17,"text":"a human.","words":[["a",262.77,262.87],["human.",262.87,263.17]]},{"start":264.09,"end":269.23,"text":"If this is in fact true, then we think this could be an effective way to identify them.","words":[["If",264.09,264.45],["this",264.45,264.73],["is",264.73,264.89],["in",264.89,264.99],["fact",264.99,265.33],["true,",265.33,265.77],["then",266.27,266.49],["we",266.49,266.67],["think",266.67,266.93],["this",266.93,267.17],["could",267.17,267.35],["be",267.35,267.47],["an",267.47,267.57],["effective",267.57,267.95],["way",267.95,268.27],["to",268.27,268.41],["identify",268.41,268.91],["them.",268.91,269.23]]},{"start":269.89,"end":275.03,"text":"Our second aim is to come up with a diagram of sea lion whisker patterns, so this can","words":[["Our",269.89,270.41],["second",270.41,270.77],["aim",270.77,271.05],["is",271.05,271.23],["to",271.23,271.35],["come",271.35,271.55],["up",271.55,271.65],["with",271.65,271.81],["a",271.81,271.89],["diagram",271.89,272.37],["of",272.37,272.65],["sea",272.65,272.91],["lion",272.91,273.21],["whisker",273.21,273.53],["patterns,",273.53,273.97],["so",274.31,274.65],["this",274.65,274.83],["can",274.83,275.03]]},{"start":275.03,"end":277.61,"text":"be used as a guide for us and other studies.","words":[["be",275.03,275.19],["used",275.19,275.45],["as",275.45,275.65],["a",275.65,275.75],["guide",275.75,276.03],["for",276.03,276.49],["us",276.49,276.77],["and",276.77,276.93],["other",276.93,277.21],["studies.",277.21,277.61]]},{"start":278.69,"end":281.75,"text":"We're using a few different methods to help us do all this.","words":[["We're",278.69,279.01],["using",279.01,279.31],["a",279.31,279.47],["few",279.47,279.65],["different",279.65,279.93],["methods",279.93,280.35],["to",280.35,280.57],["help",280.57,280.83],["us",280.83,281.05],["do",281.05,281.29],["all",281.29,281.49],["this.",281.49,281.75]]},{"start":282.33,"end":285.55,"text":"We know that we need to build up a wide range of visual data.","words":[["We",282.33,282.67],["know",282.67,282.93],["that",282.93,283.13],["we",283.13,283.25],["need",283.25,283.37],["to",283.37,283.53],["build",283.53,283.71],["up",283.71,283.85],["a",283.85,283.97],["wide",283.97,284.23],["range",284.23,284.59],["of",284.59,284.73],["visual",284.73,285.11],["data.",285.11,285.55]]},{"start":286.15,"end":290.61,"text":"So firstly, we've been in touch with zoos around Australia to gather photographs from","words":[["So",286.15,286.43],["firstly,",286.43,286.85],["we've",287.21,287.37],["been",287.37,287.49],["in",287.49,287.59],["touch",287.59,287.79],["with",287.79,288.01],["zoos",288.01,288.53],["around",288.53,288.77],["Australia",288.77,289.27],["to",289.27,289.49],["gather",289.49,289.65],["photographs",289.65,290.13],["from",290.13,290.61]]},{"start":290.61,"end":293.43,"text":"them of the faces of any sea lions they have.","words":[["them",290.61,290.75],["of",290.75,291.17],["the",291.17,291.29],["faces",291.29,291.61],["of",291.61,291.87],["any",291.87,292.17],["sea",292.17,292.47],["lions",292.47,292.85],["they",292.85,293.11],["have.",293.11,293.43]]},{"start":294.15,"end":298.69,"text":"This won't be enough to achieve our purpose though, so we're also broadening our search","words":[["This",294.15,294.61],["won't",294.61,294.83],["be",294.83,294.97],["enough",294.97,295.21],["to",295.21,295.39],["achieve",295.39,295.67],["our",295.67,295.87],["purpose",295.87,296.25],["though,",296.25,296.57],["so",296.77,297.21],["we're",297.21,297.39],["also",297.39,297.71],["broadening",297.71,298.23],["our",298.23,298.41],["search",298.41,298.69]]},{"start":298.69,"end":301.39,"text":"by inviting the public to take part in our research.","words":[["by",298.69,298.93],["inviting",298.93,299.33],["the",299.33,299.51],["public",299.51,299.85],["to",299.85,300.13],["take",300.13,300.35],["part",300.35,300.67],["in",300.67,300.81],["our",300.81,300.93],["research.",300.93,301.39]]},{"start":302.33,"end":306.31,"text":"We're hoping this will result in hundreds of useful images we can use.","words":[["We're",302.33,302.61],["hoping",302.61,302.89],["this",302.89,303.37],["will",303.37,303.53],["result",303.53,303.97],["in",303.97,304.15],["hundreds",304.15,304.51],["of",304.51,304.75],["useful",304.75,305.05],["images",305.05,305.49],["we",305.49,305.75],["can",305.75,305.97],["use.",305.97,306.31]]},{"start":309.83,"end":311.87,"text":"That is the end of Part 4.","words":[["That",309.83,310.35],["is",310.35,310.49],["the",310.49,310.65],["end",310.65,311.05],["of",311.05,311.25],["Part",311.25,311.49],["4.",311.49,311.87]]},{"start":312.73,"end":316.51,"text":"You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 4.","words":[["You",312.73,312.97],["now",312.97,313.25],["have",313.25,313.63],["one",313.63,313.93],["minute",313.93,314.33],["to",314.33,314.59],["check",314.59,314.89],["your",314.89,315.07],["answers",315.07,315.55],["to",315.55,315.81],["Part",315.81,316.03],["4.",316.03,316.51]]}]}